# armour/<body>/skirt_split_back: SPLIT's two long tails behind the legs, beside the boots to y -2;
# they swing apart on the walk's contact (wide) and stream on the run (flare), never across a leg.
# Generated from the FORGE-LIMBS skirt templates (gen_skirts2.py, skirts_def.py; iteration 2: the D view serves U, `tags anyfacing`); Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
